{"id":"2873206535","kind":"answer","title":"零基础如何规划，有效益的学习英语?","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"外语习得","date":"2023-02-02","updated":"2023-02-02","votes":93,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":582,"keywords":["二语习得","沉浸式学习","Refold","可理解输入","Anki"],"summary":"以下内容是 @Thoughts Memo 汉化组翻译的，0 基础学外语的教程，同样适用于英语。 从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（简化版） 阶段 0：Refold 概述 在开始语言学习之旅前，你需要做好准备。本节将带你了解在整个语言学习过程中将会用到的方法、思想和工具。 A：了解方法 0A：什么是沉浸式语言学习？ 0A…","question_detail_html":"<p>属于零基础，对英语完全属于门外汉的人，如何做最有效的现阶段学习计划，并且整个过程如何安排递进。</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/577680462/answer/2873206535","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（简化版）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"阶段 0：Refold 概述"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"A：了解方法"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"阶段 1：学会基础"},{"id":"sec-5","level":3,"title":"A：准备工具和建立习惯"},{"id":"sec-6","level":2,"title":"阶段 2：学会理解"},{"id":"sec-7","level":3,"title":"A：克服困难"},{"id":"sec-8","level":3,"title":"B：提高难度"},{"id":"sec-9","level":3,"title":"C：掌握领域"},{"id":"sec-10","level":2,"title":"阶段 3：学会口语"},{"id":"sec-11","level":3,"title":"A：准备输出"},{"id":"sec-12","level":3,"title":"B：学习写作"},{"id":"sec-13","level":3,"title":"C：学习口语"},{"id":"sec-14","level":2,"title":"阶段 4：超越流利"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"oKtO6nXz\">以下内容是 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"3c9990a12cdbcd92e20b1387b160f0a3\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$3c9990a12cdbcd92e20b1387b160f0a3\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/JarrettYe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组翻译的，0 基础学外语的教程，同样适用于英语。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><span class=\"nolink\">从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（简化版）</span></h2><h2 id=\"sec-2\">阶段 0：Refold 概述</h2><p data-pid=\"gjnW9dEr\">在开始语言学习之旅前，你需要做好准备。本节将带你了解在整个语言学习过程中将会用到的方法、思想和工具。</p><h3 id=\"sec-3\">A：了解方法</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"kKkJs1yS\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"563595807\" href=\"#/post/563595807\">0A：什么是沉浸式语言学习？</a></li><li data-pid=\"QoFdNX6n\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"564167912\" href=\"#/post/564167912\">0A：语言学习的三种方式</a></li><li data-pid=\"XsEeODNl\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"564635314\" href=\"#/post/564635314\">0A：我目前处于哪一阶段？</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-4\">阶段 1：学会基础</h2><p data-pid=\"aNBJvQVf\">为沉浸式语言学习建立技能、工具和习惯，并通过学习你目标外语的基本语法和词汇来启动你的理解。</p><h3 id=\"sec-5\">A：准备工具和建立习惯</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"z6AszBFn\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565389270\" href=\"#/post/565389270\">1A：沉浸学习</a></li><li data-pid=\"w3-UIfve\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565583093\" href=\"#/post/565583093\">1A：打下外语基础</a></li><li data-pid=\"CrS_WDw3\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"565801338\" href=\"#/post/565801338\">1A：背单词</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-6\">阶段 2：学会理解</h2><p data-pid=\"tA8u0bqH\">直接在沉浸中学习，直到你完全理解。</p><h3 id=\"sec-7\">A：克服困难</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"l5RLARSl\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"566431464\" href=\"#/post/566431464\">2A：精细沉浸</a></li><li data-pid=\"5tccPO1f\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"566658094\" href=\"#/post/566658094\">2A：词句挖掘</a></li><li data-pid=\"Vg8HCbhJ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"567218773\" href=\"#/post/567218773\">2A：衡量理解能力</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-8\">B：提高难度</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"hoNVffCE\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"567740543\" href=\"#/post/567740543\">2B：沉浸学习指南</a></li><li data-pid=\"k9bzf1Ox\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"568236210\" href=\"#/post/568236210\">2B：阅读</a></li><li data-pid=\"uWvBVgBw\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"568506042\" href=\"#/post/568506042\">2B：转向单语词典</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-9\">C：掌握领域</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"K7ZArS4l\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"570304700\" href=\"#/post/570304700\">2C：专注主题</a></li><li data-pid=\"wcBdgsPq\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"572241126\" href=\"#/post/572241126\">2C：掌握一个领域</a></li><li data-pid=\"95q4lUuR\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"572600379\" href=\"#/post/572600379\">2C：沉浸学习指南</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-10\">阶段 3：学会口语</h2><p data-pid=\"yUaiOBMi\">把你习得的语言转化为口语能力。</p><h3 id=\"sec-11\">A：准备输出</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"_VhmppmZ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"577958313\" href=\"#/post/577958313\">3A：开始写作</a></li><li data-pid=\"jqyMM_ET\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"578482733\" href=\"#/post/578482733\">3A：认领语言家长</a></li><li data-pid=\"ehZrDxR0\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"579111390\" href=\"#/post/579111390\">3A：新领域：真实对话</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-12\">B：学习写作</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"iGxYDUnz\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"579995057\" href=\"#/post/579995057\">3B：激活语言</a></li><li data-pid=\"fOiWxiqn\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"580682047\" href=\"#/post/580682047\">3B：发音</a></li><li data-pid=\"G6elY0Li\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"584034158\" href=\"#/post/584034158\">3B：活动指南</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-13\">C：学习口语</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"Rm53qEcl\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"584490294\" href=\"#/post/584490294\">3C：能力与表现</a></li><li data-pid=\"zLcxGw4R\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"585570298\" href=\"#/post/585570298\">3C：常见语言能力弱项</a></li><li data-pid=\"fNz4Mq7q\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"585891018\" href=\"#/post/585891018\">3C：口语练习</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-14\">阶段 4：超越流利</h2><p data-pid=\"qZKwU7u5\">敬请期待！</p><blockquote data-pid=\"zLS_37v0\">原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/simplified/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Simple Roadmap | Refold</a></blockquote>","rec_chain":[{"id":"563595807","title":"0A：什么是沉浸式语言学习？","author":"Refold","votes":160,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"564167912","title":"0A：语言学习的三种方式","author":"Refold","votes":146,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"565389270"